\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {17}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Master grid, CodeLlama-7B.} Every condition and every stack, forward (output prediction) and backward (input prediction). Per system: \emph  {acc} raw accuracy; $\Delta $ points against the untuned model on the same condition; \% accuracy as a percentage of the untuned model's clean-code accuracy in the same direction, i.e.\ how much of the original accuracy the system brings back (100 = the untuned model on clean code). \emph  {fmt}: format-failure rate above 0.25, the cell measures the prompt contract rather than the task and enters no mean. Pooled rows average the stacks above them. `--': cell not run.}}{23}{table.caption.19}\protected@file@percent }
